      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [280, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Next step\nAdd Email node → To `{{ $json.patientEmail }}`\nSubject: Payment received — {{ $json.serviceName }}\nInclude amount + reference.\n\nActivate → set Vercel `N8N_WEBHOOK_PAYMENT`.",
